 "kind": "trial",
 "note": "Thumb exp high-word layout: the 512 aux words of t_eps rows 0..511 (stride-16 interleaved) copied unchanged into contiguous uint32_t t_hb[512]; the 8 stride-16 loads in t_mt, t_mn, t_exp_res, t_exp_den and the two xrow/xkm/xkq table loads in t_eik_exp now index t_hb. t_eps is untouched, so aliases (t_xrow, t_xkm, t_xkq, t_dkn, tanh/sigmoid row pointers, dead NaN-branch t_eps casts) keep their data. Result: thumbv6m +2084 bytes, S worse; rv32im identical code (EIK_SEL selects the _r path).",
